That's my helmet, wanker.

1631
01:29:38,620 --> 01:29:40,479
- No... not yet. I'll pay.
- No, I am paying.

1632
01:29:40,559 --> 01:29:43,138
- No, no, I need it.
- I'm gonna pay this time.

1633
