Kunnu, we should do two things.

1649
01:30:38,114 --> 01:30:40,034
- What?
- First, we should turn around.

1650
01:30:40,242 --> 01:30:42,742
- And then run.
- Yes. Come on.

1651
01:30:42,909 --> 01:30:44,079
Jass, my son.

1652
01:30:52,202 --> 01:30:53,659
- Mom!
- Mom!

1653
01:30:54,242 --> 01:30:55,409
Jass...

1654
01:30:56,659 --> 01:30:57,534
Mom?

1655
01:30:57,614 --> 01:31:00,617
- Mom's here. Mom's here.
- Mom's here. Mom's here.

1656
01:31:00,701 --> 01:31:01,534
Greetings, aunty.

1657
01:31:01,701 --> 01:31:03,367
Mom, I need you.

1658
01:31:04,736 --> 01:31:07,284
- So excited to see me?
- Yes.

1659
01:31:07,451 --> 01:31:09,492
Even I wasn't so excited
when you were born.

1660
01:31:09,867 --> 01:31:13,534
But mom, you didn't inform us
you'll be here.

1661
01:31:13,614 --> 01:31:14,826
You were never going to call me here.

1662
01:31:15,159 --> 01:31:19,409
Daughter-in-law, I got tired of
asking him when will I become a grandma.

1663
01:31:19,907 --> 01:31:21,201
Did you tell your mom about it?

1664
01:31:22,198 --> 01:31:23,951
Even I just found out.

1665
01:31:24,409 --> 01:31:27,201
Baani called me up and
gave me the good news.

1666
01:31:27,409 --> 01:31:30,242
She bought my ticket. Arranged my visa.

1667
01:31:30,367 --> 01:31:32,034
Hired a caretaker for the house.

1668
01:31:32,937 --> 01:31:35,326
She's my daughter,
not my daughter-in-law.

1669
01:31:37,972 --> 01:31:39,076
Bonding.

1670
01:31:40,367 --> 01:31:43,451
See, what I got for
my daughter from Punjab.

1671
01:31:43,742 --> 01:31:45,784
Sweets made of
dry fruit and fenugreek.

1672
01:31:45,997 --> 01:31:48,492
You could've sent it by courier.
You didn't have to come here, Mom.

1673
01:31:48,576 --> 01:31:49,534
Shut up.

1674
